            <div class="carousel-inner">
                <div class="carousel-item active">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 1">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Consectetur Adipisicing Elit</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$29.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 2">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Beatae Doloribu</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$34.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 3">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Accusantium Eius Soluta</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$19.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="carousel-item">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 4">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Product Name 4</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$24.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 5">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Product Name 5</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$39.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 product-card">
                                <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/shutterstock/photos/2616335893/display_1500/stock-photo-a-delicious-and-hot-serving-of-chicken-wings-with-a-golden-color-and-crispy-coating-presented-in-a-2616335893.jpg"
                                    class="card-img-top" alt="Product 6">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h6 class="card-title text-center">Product Name 6</h6>
                                    <p class="card-text text-center text-muted mb-2">$44.99</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success">View Details</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Carousel Indicators -->
            <div class="carousel-indicators position-static mt-3">
                <button type="button" data-bs-target="#productCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active bg-success"
                    aria-current="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
                <button type="button" data-bs-target="#productCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="1" class="bg-success"
                    aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container-fluid faq-section py-5">
    <div class="container my-4">
        <div class="row mb-5">
            <div class="col-12">
                <h2 class="text-center fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="heading-underline bg-success mx-auto"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionFlushExample">
            <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingOne">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-success fw-semibold" type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-collapseOne" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="flush-collapseOne">
                        How does UpShare work?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="flush-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="flush-headingOne"
                    data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        UpShare is a platform that allows users to share and rent items they don't use regularly. Simply
                        browse listings,
                        request to rent an item, and arrange pickup with the owner. After using the item, return it in
                        the same condition.
                        You can also list your own items to earn extra income from things you don't use every day.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingTwo">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-success fw-semibold" type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="flush-collapseTwo">
                        How is my payment protected?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="flush-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="flush-headingTwo"
                    data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        We use secure payment processing through trusted partners. Funds are held in escrow until the
                        rental is complete,
                        giving both parties protection. If there's any issue with your rental, our customer service team
                        is available
                        to help resolve disputes fairly and efficiently.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingThree">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-success fw-semibold" type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="flush-collapseThree">
                        What if an item is damaged during rental?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="flush-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="flush-headingThree"
                    data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        UpShare provides insurance coverage for most rentals. If an item is damaged, the renter is
                        responsible for
                        covering repair costs up to a certain amount. For high-value items, we recommend owners request
                        a security deposit.
                        All damages should be reported immediately through our app to initiate the resolution process.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-headingFour">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed text-success fw-semibold" type="button"
                        data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="flush-collapseFour">
                        Can I cancel a reservation?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="flush-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="flush-headingFour"
                    data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, you can cancel a reservation, but terms vary depending on timing. Cancellations made more
                        than 48 hours
                        before the rental period receive a full refund. For cancellations within 48 hours, a 50% fee
                        applies.
                        Owners who cancel reservations may be subject to penalties to ensure reliability on our
                        platform.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>